    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Opportunities and challenges in the remediation of metal-contaminated soils by using tobacco (Nicotiana tabacum L.): a critical review","description":"The successful phytoextraction of potentially toxic elements (PTEs) from polluted soils can be achieved by growing non-food and industrial crops. Tobacco (Nicotiana tabacum L.) is one of the main industrial crops and is widely grown in many countries. Tobacco can uptake high concentrations of PTEs especially in aboveground biomass without suffering from toxicity. This review highlighted the potential of tobacco for the phytoextraction of heavy metals and tolerance mechanisms under metal stress. Different management practices have been discussed which can enhance the potential of this plant for metal extraction. Finally, suitable options for the management/disposal of biomass enriched in excess metal have been elaborated to prevent secondary pollution.","datePublished":"2019-05-15T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2019-05-15T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"18053","pageEnd":"18070","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11356-019-05391-9","keywords":["Potentially toxic elements (PTEs)","Hyperaccumulation","Tobacco","Contaminated soils","Environment","general","Environmental Chemistry","Ecotoxicology","Environmental Health","Atmospheric Protection/Air Quality Control/Air Pollution","Waste Water Technology / Water Pollution Control / Water Management / Aquatic Pollution"],"image":[],"isPartOf":{"name":"Environmental Science and Pollution Research","issn":["1614-7499","0944-1344"],"volumeNumber":"26","@type":["Periodical","PublicationVolume"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer Berlin Heidelberg","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Muhammad Zia ur Rehman","affiliation":[{"name":"University of Agriculture","address":{"name":"Institute of Soil and Environmental Sciences, University of Agriculture, Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Muhammad Rizwan","affiliation":[{"name":"Government College University","address":{"name":"Department of Environmental Sciences and Engineering, Government College University, Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"mrazi1532@yahoo.com","@type":"Person"},{"name":"Muhammad Irfan Sohail","affiliation":[{"name":"University of Agriculture","address":{"name":"Institute of Soil and Environmental Sciences, University of Agriculture, Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Shafaqat Ali","affiliation":[{"name":"Government College University","address":{"name":"Department of Environmental Sciences and Engineering, Government College University, Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"shafaqataligill@yahoo.com","@type":"Person"},{"name":"Aisha A. Waris","affiliation":[{"name":"University of Agriculture","address":{"name":"Institute of Soil and Environmental Sciences, University of Agriculture, Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Hinnan Khalid","affiliation":[{"name":"University of Agriculture","address":{"name":"Institute of Soil and Environmental Sciences, University of Agriculture, Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Asif Naeem","affiliation":[{"name":"Nuclear Institute for Agriculture and Biology (NIAB)","address":{"name":"Nuclear Institute for Agriculture and Biology (NIAB), Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Hamaad Raza Ahmad","affiliation":[{"name":"University of Agriculture","address":{"name":"Institute of Soil and Environmental Sciences, University of Agriculture, Faisalabad, Pakistan","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@